    },
    {
      "videoId": "RkdbSxyXftc",
      "sentenceId": "s0012",
      "text": "During the past 400,000 years, there have been four major periods of glaciation -- meaning that vast sheets of ice covered a good part of the globe -- interrupted by brief interglacial periods.",
