      "videoId": "RkdbSxyXftc",
      "sentenceId": "s0042",
      "text": "Predicting the climate, one of the most complex systems on earth with thousands of inputs, many of which we don&#39;t understand, isn&#39;t an exact science, or anything close to it.",
